        "problem": "Simplify ${sin}^{2}\u2061w\\,(1+{cot}^{2}\u2061w).$",
        "worked_solution": "Using the identity $1+{cot}^{2}\u2061w={csc}^{2}\u2061w,$ we rewrite and simplify the expression as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{sin}^{2}\u2061w\\,(1+{cot}^{2}\u2061w) & ={sin}^{2}\u2061w\\cdot {csc}^{2}\u2061w \\\\  & ={sin}^{2}\u2061w\\cdot {(\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{sin}\u2061w})}^{2} \\\\  & ={sin}^{2}\u2061w\\cdot \\frac{1}{{sin}^{2}\u2061w} \\\\  & =1\\end{aligned}\n$$",
